{"title":"Career Roadmap · Academic Coordinator","role":"Academic Coordinator","summary":"An Academic Coordinator supports the academic functioning of a school, college, coaching organisation, EdTech company, training institute or education programme.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (General / Honours)","Course":"Education"},"about":[{"label":"Education","text":"Undergraduate"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Academic Coordinator supports the academic functioning of a school, college, coaching organisation, EdTech company, training institute or education programme."},{"type":"p","text":"The role typically sits between teachers/faculty, students, parents, management and academic leadership. Responsibilities may include academic scheduling, curriculum implementation, student progress tracking, faculty coordination, examinations, academic records, events and quality improvement."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Education provides a good foundation, particularly for school, EdTech, coaching and education-programme coordination. However, some institutions may prefer candidates with a B.Ed., M.Ed., teaching experience or a specialised education qualification, especially when the role includes substantial curriculum or academic leadership responsibilities."},{"type":"note","label":"Important distinction","text":"Academic Coordinator is generally an education-management/coordination role. It is not automatically the same as a qualified school teacher or principal."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Reality"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"Good to Very Good"}],[{"text":"Direct entry after UG"},{"text":"Possible, especially coordinator/academic operations roles"}],[{"text":"Teaching qualification"},{"text":"May be required for roles involving formal teaching"}],[{"text":"B.Ed. requirement"},{"text":"Institution/job dependent"}],[{"text":"Administrative skills"},{"text":"Very Important"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Curriculum knowledge"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Data/analytics"},{"text":"Increasingly important"}],[{"text":"EdTech skills"},{"text":"Highly valuable"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Not always required"}],[{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Very valuable for senior coordination roles"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does an Academic Coordinator Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Academic Coordinator may be responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coordinating teachers/faculty"},{"text":"Preparing academic calendars"},{"text":"Managing timetables"},{"text":"Coordinating examinations"},{"text":"Tracking student attendance"},{"text":"Monitoring student performance"},{"text":"Supporting curriculum implementation"},{"text":"Coordinating lesson plans"},{"text":"Organising academic events"},{"text":"Communicating with parents"},{"text":"Preparing academic reports"},{"text":"Maintaining student records"},{"text":"Coordinating faculty meetings"},{"text":"Supporting teacher training"},{"text":"Monitoring academic quality"},{"text":"Supporting accreditation/compliance activities"},{"text":"Coordinating remedial and enrichment programmes"},{"text":"Working with EdTech platforms and LMS systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"In larger institutions, the role can become increasingly data-driven."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Education Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a strong understanding of how educational institutions operate."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foundations of education"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Learning theories"},{"text":"Child and adolescent development"},{"text":"Teaching-learning processes"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Educational sociology"},{"text":"Introduction to curriculum"},{"text":"Educational assessment"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Google Workspace"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a:"},{"type":"h","text":"Student Academic Progress Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Assessment scores"},{"text":"Assignment completion"},{"text":"Participation"},{"text":"Improvement areas"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Academic Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start learning how academic programmes are actually coordinated."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum planning"},{"text":"Lesson-plan coordination"},{"text":"Academic calendars"},{"text":"Timetable management"},{"text":"Examination planning"},{"text":"Student records"},{"text":"Faculty coordination"},{"text":"Parent communication"},{"text":"Student support"},{"text":"Academic event management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Google Forms"},{"text":"Google Classroom"},{"text":"Microsoft Teams"},{"text":"Zoom"},{"text":"Learning Management Systems"},{"text":"Student Information Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete:"},{"type":"h","text":"School Academic Management Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Student performance"},{"text":"Teacher workload"},{"text":"Subject performance"},{"text":"Examination results"},{"text":"At-risk students"},{"text":"Monthly academic trends"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Data + Curriculum + Leadership","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should now move from basic coordination to academic decision support."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum evaluation"},{"text":"Assessment design"},{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Competency-based education"},{"text":"Academic quality assurance"},{"text":"Faculty development"},{"text":"Student counselling basics"},{"text":"Educational technology"},{"text":"Academic data analysis"},{"text":"Institutional reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Power Query","Power BI","Basic SQL"]},{"type":"p","text":"Optional:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python/pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the coordinator to move beyond administrative work into academic analytics."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student performance dashboard"},{"text":"Teacher workload dashboard"},{"text":"Attendance-risk model"},{"text":"Course feedback analysis"},{"text":"Examination-result analysis"},{"text":"Academic calendar management system"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Portfolio Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Education foundation"},{"text":"Psychology, learning, communication"},{"text":"Student progress tracker"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Academic operations"},{"text":"Timetables, curriculum, LMS, Excel"},{"text":"Academic management dashboard"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Academic analytics"},{"text":"Power BI, assessment, QA"},{"text":"Student-performance analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional readiness"},{"text":"Coordination, leadership, reporting"},{"text":"Complete academic coordination portfolio"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a three-year BA programme, the Year 4 activities can be completed during the final year."}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Learning theories, curriculum, assessment"}],[{"text":"Academic administration"},{"text":"Scheduling, records, examinations"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Faculty, student and parent communication"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Reports, minutes, academic records"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"LMS, SIS, Google Workspace, MS Office"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, Power BI, basic SQL"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Planning, coordination, problem solving"}],[{"text":"Student support"},{"text":"Mentoring, academic intervention"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Academic monitoring and evaluation"}],[{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Workshops, seminars, examinations"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted academic workflows and analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships should provide actual exposure to educational operations, rather than only teaching observation."},{"type":"h","text":"Good internship environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"Colleges"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Coaching institutes"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Skill-development organisations"},{"text":"Educational NGOs"},{"text":"Training institutes"},{"text":"Career-counselling organisations"},{"text":"Education consulting companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic Coordinator Intern"},{"text":"Academic Operations Intern"},{"text":"Education Programme Intern"},{"text":"Teaching Assistant"},{"text":"Curriculum Intern"},{"text":"Student Success Intern"},{"text":"Learning & Development Intern"},{"text":"EdTech Operations Intern"},{"text":"Academic Content Intern"},{"text":"Assessment Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Education/teaching-support exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Academic operations in